{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KonKer Battles: First Release</strong> is a third-person magical action PvE game where you follow the story of <strong>Lum</strong>, an enigmatic being with no memory of its origin \u2014 evolving its form as it discovers the true purpose of its existence.<br>To achieve that, Lum must travel through multiple universes that distort perception and threaten to rewrite reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each universe introduces new challenges, mechanics, powers, and unique atmospheres.<br>The journey begins in <strong>The Universe of Mystery</strong>, a cursed realm where dark sorcerers have stolen ancient gems capable of controlling the minds of any being\u2026 even Lum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore semi-open maps, master magical abilities in dynamic combat, gather fragments of a forbidden power, and piece together the truth \u2014 <strong>before darkness\u2026 or illusion consumes you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE action with intelligent AI (no online multiplayer required)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission-based progression and magical artifact crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic <i>shoot \u2018em up</i>-style combat + free exploration zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolutive magic system \u2014 unlock, combine and modify your powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living maps with alternate paths, traps and surprise events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level duration: 25\u201345 minutes \u2014 ideal for intense and replayable sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding multiversal narrative, starting with the Universe of Mystery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don\u2019t just fight \u2014 you shape the story, season after season.</strong><br>Each portal opens a new universe whose mechanics, enemies and artifacts directly affect the worlds that follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And what you see today\u2026 is only the spark of a universe about to awaken.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109990?t=1763146930","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109990?t=1763146930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109990/45ebfb16c0c173d3a23dd74e2d4c5b564d41c31e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763146930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109990/45ebfb16c0c173d3a23dd74e2d4c5b564d41c31e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763146930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KonKer Battles: First Release</strong> is a third-person magical action PvE game where you follow the story of <strong>Lum</strong>, an enigmatic being with no memory of its origin \u2014 evolving its form as it discovers the true purpose of its existence.<br>To achieve that, Lum must travel through multiple universes that distort perception and threaten to rewrite reality itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each universe introduces new challenges, mechanics, powers, and unique atmospheres.<br>The journey begins in <strong>The Universe of Mystery</strong>, a cursed realm where dark sorcerers have stolen ancient gems capable of controlling the minds of any being\u2026 even Lum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore semi-open maps, master magical abilities in dynamic combat, gather fragments of a forbidden power, and piece together the truth \u2014 <strong>before darkness\u2026 or illusion consumes you.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvE action with intelligent AI (no online multiplayer required)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mission-based progression and magical artifact crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic <i>shoot \u2018em up</i>-style combat + free exploration zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolutive magic system \u2014 unlock, combine and modify your powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living maps with alternate paths, traps and surprise events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level duration: 25\u201345 minutes \u2014 ideal for intense and replayable sessions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expanding multiversal narrative, starting with the Universe of Mystery</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You don\u2019t just fight \u2014 you shape the story, season after season.</strong><br>Each portal opens a new universe whose mechanics, enemies and artifacts directly affect the worlds that follow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And what you see today\u2026 is only the spark of a universe about to awaken.</strong></p>","developers":["Impacta Games"],"dlc":[4110440],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109990/c8656607ff68fb721db9f932557a6bd8579e9523/header.jpg?t=1763146930","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class